{"title":"Spelling competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"US_Spelling_Competitions\">US Spelling Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spelling_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: US Spelling Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elementary_and_Middle_School\">Elementary and Middle School</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spelling_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Elementary and Middle School\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scripps_National_Spelling_Bee&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Scripps National Spelling Bee (page does not exist)\">National Spelling Bee</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.spellingbee.com/\">website</a>) – The most well-known spelling bee for elementary and middle school students in the United States.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=North_South_Foundation_Spelling_Bee&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"North South Foundation Spelling Bee (page does not exist)\">North South Foundation Spelling Bee</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.northsouth.org/\">website</a>) – A spelling competition designed to help students prepare for the National Spelling Bee.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=South_Asian_Spelling_Bee&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"South Asian Spelling Bee (page does not exist)\">South Asian Spelling Bee</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.southasianspellingbee.com/\">website</a>) – A spelling bee specifically for South Asian American students.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Spelling_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vocabulary_competitions\" title=\"Vocabulary competitions\">Vocabulary competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Foreign_language_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Foreign language competitions (page does not exist)\">Foreign language competitions</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Spelling_competitions&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110909\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 304/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.247      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.247      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2002:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110909 and revision id 274074. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}